<section class="about-mission">
    <div class="container">
        <p>We're Satnam and Julie, cofounders of The Channel. We met at a dance studio, bonded over a shared belief that life should be full of depth, joy, and real connection — and built an app to help people experience exactly that. The Channel started as an experiment in combining AI with deep personality science, and grew into something we never expected: a tool that genuinely helps people see themselves and their relationships more clearly.</p>
