                <p>Julie is an English language instructor with a rare gift for seeing the beauty in people and mirroring it back to them. Her emotional depth and intuition shaped the soul of The Channel's AI — the warmth, the perceptiveness, the way it makes you feel truly seen.</p>
                <p>She's a passionate dancer, a compassionate listener, and the person who makes sure The Channel never feels like just another app. When Julie talks to someone, they walk away understanding themselves a little better. That's exactly what she built into every interaction.</p>
