                <p>Satnam is a software engineer and competitive ballroom dancer — 1st place at Seattle Star Ball 2024 and 2025, and training for the National Championship. He built The Channel's entire technical platform: the AI engine, the backend infrastructure, and the mobile app.</p>
                <p>His vision was to combine sophisticated AI with deep personality science to create something that actually helps people understand themselves and their relationships. He brings relentless dedication to everything he builds — and a belief that technology should serve human connection, not replace it.</p>
